     The hhoossttss..llppdd file contains a list of hostnames or IP addresses that are
     allowed to use your local print services.  List every hostname or IP ad‐
     dress on a line itself.

     If you want to allow access for any and all host, you can usually use the
     NIS netgroups feature to do this by adding a line with a single ‘+’ char‐
     acter.

